  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h2>Join Safely 🩷</h2><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Safely was founded by four women who bonded over one simple truth: we all deserve to feel safe. Today, we're building more than products. We're building a movement to empower women, runners, students, travelers, moms, and everyday adventurers to take charge of their safety with confidence.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">As a Safely Ambassador, you'll earn commission, unlock exclusive opportunities, and become part of a supportive community creating a safer tomorrow.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">✨ Earn commission on every sale<br>✨ Unlock bonuses and special challenges<br>✨ Get early access to launches and exclusive opportunities<br>✨ Invite friends and earn from their success<br>✨ Join a community of women making a difference</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Whether you're a runner, creator, student, hiker, traveler, fitness enthusiast, or simply passionate about empowering others, we'd love to have you on the team.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Getting started is easy:</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>1. Apply.</strong><br>Complete your application and hear back from us within 48 hours.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>2. Get your tools.</strong><br>Once approved, you'll receive a special discount, your custom link, and everything you need to start sharing.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>3. Live Safely.</strong><br>Promote personal safety, inspire others, and start earning commissions while making a real impact.</p><p>A safer tomorrow starts today. We'd love for you to be part of it.</p></div>",
